# Dataset Licensing & Attribution Notice

The MIT License above DOES NOT cover the audio dataset or derived synthetic audio recordings.

The synthetic audio scenes in this project are constructed from real environmental sound recordings sourced from the ESC-50 dataset:
- Reference: Karol J. Piczak (2015), "ESC: Dataset for Environmental Sound Classification", ACM Multimedia.
- Source URL: https://github.com/karolpiczak/ESC-50
- License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 (CC BY-NC 3.0).

All audio files, mixes, and synthetic scenes derived from ESC-50 are provided for non-commercial research and educational purposes only under the terms of CC BY-NC 3.0.
